### The Evaluation Decision Tree

When building an evaluation pipeline, follow this mental framework:

```
Can you measure functional correctness automatically?
├── YES → Use it (code unit tests, SQL execution, game scores)
└── NO → Do you have reference data?
         ├── YES → Lexical similarity (BLEU/ROUGE) or Semantic similarity (BERTScore)
         └── NO → Artificial intelligence as a judge (pointwise or pairwise)

Do you need to RANK models rather than score them?
└── YES → Comparative evaluation (Elo or Bradley-Terry rating system)

Always supplement artificial intelligence judges with:
├── Exact evaluation methods where possible
└── Human spot-checks on a random sample
```

